{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlide\/color","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLSlideV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"color","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlslide\/color"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlide"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","title":"MXLColor","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSlide":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlide","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSlide"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Glissando and slide types both indicate rapidly moving from one pitch to the other so that individual notes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"are not discerned. A slide is continuous between the two pitches and defaults to a solid line. The optional","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"text for a slide is printed alongside the line.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MXLSlide","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlslide","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSlide"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSlide/color":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlslide\/color","role":"symbol","title":"color","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSlide\/color","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}]}}}